---
description: Sellbase commerce rules
alwaysApply: true
---
This project sells with Sellbase. Use the `sellbase` MCP server. Start with `store_status`; use `docs_search` when unsure.

- Money is an integer in minor units (19990 = $199.90). Never compute prices, totals or stock in the browser.
- Orders come from payment webhooks, or from `order_create` for sales outside the site. Verify with `test_purchase` (test mode).
- Do not edit the Sellbase migrations (see `.sellbase/manifest.json`) or `supabase/functions/sellbase-*`. Extend data with `metadata`.
- Storefront components live in `components/sellbase/`: edit them freely. Customize the admin only through its `config`.
- Never expose the service role key or print `.env.sellbase`.
- Ask the owner, then send `confirm: true`, for: live keys, refunds, bulk price changes, paid manual orders and webhooks.
